  "title": "POTV Bent Glass Mouthpiece",
  "description": "Bent Glass Mouthpiece for a variety of vapes\n\nUpgrade to cooler vapor with this bent glass mouthpiece (see compatible vapes below). You’ll be surprised at how much one bend in the glass cools the vapor. This mouthpiece is hot-swappable with our other glass options, even during a session.\n\nPick your color:\n\nBlue: Nestle into your serene sanctuary with the soothing hues of our blue glass.\n\nGreen: Enhance your vaping journey with the natural essence of our green glass.\n\nPink: Tune into the serene and bliss out with our soothing pink glass.\n\nPurple: Reconnect with your inner calm and luxuriate in purple’s gentle pigments.\n\nRed: Infuse your sessions with the vibrant and captivating energy of our red glass.\n\nCompatibility\n\nThe Bent Glass Mouthpiece is compatible with:\n\nPlanet of the Vapes Lobo\n\nPlanet of the Vapes ONE\n\nPOTV XMAX V3 Pro\n\nPOTV Glass Adapter for V3 Pro\n\nPAX Glass Adapter\n\nMighty+ Glass Adapter\n\nCrafty+ Glass Adapter\n\nVolcano Glass Adapter\n\nReturn policy\n\nWe only accept returns for accessories if they are within 30 days, unused and unopened, or if they are being returned with a vaporizer under our 14-day satisfaction policy.",
  "description_html": "<h2><span>Bent Glass Mouthpiece for a variety of vapes</span></h2>\n<p>Upgrade to cooler vapor with this bent glass mouthpiece (see compatible vapes below). You’ll be surprised at how much one bend in the glass cools the vapor. This mouthpiece is hot-swappable with our other glass options, even during a session.</p>\n<h2><b>Pick your color:</b></h2>\n<p><span><strong>Blue:</strong> Nestle into your serene sanctuary with the soothing hues of our blue glass. </span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Green:</strong> Enhance your vaping journey with the natural essence of our green glass.</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Pink:</strong><span> </span>Tune into the serene and bliss out with our soothing pink glass.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Purple:</strong><span> </span>Reconnect with your inner calm and luxuriate in purple’s gentle pigments.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><b>Red</b>: Infuse your sessions with the vibrant and captivating energy of our red glass.</p>\n<h2>Compatibility<br /><strong></strong> </h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The Bent Glass Mouthpiece is compatible with:</span></p>\n<p><a title=\"Planet of the Vapes Lobo Vaporizer\" href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/planet-of-the-vapes-lobo\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/planet-of-the-vapes-lobo\">Planet of the Vapes Lobo</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-one-vaporizer\" title=\"One\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-one-vaporizer\">Planet of the Vapes ONE </a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/xmax-v3-pro-vaporizer\" title=\"XMAX V3 Pro\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/xmax-v3-pro-vaporizer\">POTV XMAX V3 Pro</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"POTV Bubbler, Water Pipe &amp; Glass Accessory Adapter for V3 Pro\" href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-glass-adapter-v3-pro\">POTV Glass Adapter for V3 Pro</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-glass-accessory-adapter-for-pax\" title=\"PAX Glass Adapter Attachment\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-glass-accessory-adapter-for-pax\">PAX Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/mighty-mighty-plus-glass-adapter\" title=\"Mighty+ glass adapter\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/mighty-mighty-plus-glass-adapter\">Mighty+ Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/crafty-plus-glass-adapter\" title=\"Crafty+ Glass Adapter\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/crafty-plus-glass-adapter\">Crafty+ Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"Volno Glass Adapter\" href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/volcano-glass-adapter\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/volcano-glass-adapter\">Volcano Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<h2>Return policy</h2>\n<p>We only accept returns for accessories if they are within 30 days, unused and unopened, or if they are being returned with a vaporizer under our 14-day satisfaction policy.</p>",
